      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: Upload Service, raw Blob (direct, SAS),\nVideo metadata + outbox, Kafka, transcode orchestrator +\nworkers, processed Blob; video-ready -> search indexer +\nchannel feed updater. Subscribe / like / comment write\none row each and bump the count synchronously.\n\nREAD touches: Video Service (Redis -> Cosmos), Search\nService (AI Search), Comment Service (page-1 cache ->\nCosmos), Feed Service (pull: my channels -> channel\nlatest lists). Video bytes: CDN -> Blob origin only.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: Upload Service, raw Blob (direct, SAS),\nVideo metadata + outbox, Kafka, transcode orchestrator +\nworkers, processed Blob; video-ready -> search indexer +\nchannel feed updater. Subscribe / like / comment write\none row each and bump the count synchronously.\n\nREAD touches: Video Service (Redis -> Cosmos), Search\nService (AI Search), Comment Service (page-1 cache ->\nCosmos), Feed Service (pull: my channels -> channel\nlatest lists). Video bytes: CDN -> Blob origin only.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
