    {
      "id": "Bsum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1530.0,
      "y": 2000.0,
      "width": 556.0,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4633,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4640,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: upload as in A; video-ready pre-warms CDN\nPOPs; NO fan-out to 100M subscriber feeds (they pull).\nLikes / subs keyed by userId, so writes spread out; only\nthe COUNT is hot -> Kafka -> aggregator -> 1 write/s.\nComments keyed (videoId, hour) so one partition never\nholds them all.\n\nREAD touches: in-process cache + Redis replicas for the\nwatch page, popular-query cache, top-comments cache,\nhot channel list; segments: CDN -> shield -> Blob.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: upload as in A; video-ready pre-warms CDN\nPOPs; NO fan-out to 100M subscriber feeds (they pull).\nLikes / subs keyed by userId, so writes spread out; only\nthe COUNT is hot -> Kafka -> aggregator -> 1 write/s.\nComments keyed (videoId, hour) so one partition never\nholds them all.\n\nREAD touches: in-process cache + Redis replicas for the\nwatch page, popular-query cache, top-comments cache,\nhot channel list; segments: CDN -> shield -> Blob.",
